-- expect-refusal: subsumption assr_lat: it has dominance rules and is declared a lattice or a tag too
-- one algebra per relation: a lattice's cell holds one value, an antichain many
edb(assr_le).
assr_le(a, 1).
lattice assr_lat(A, min V).
assr_lat(A, V) :- assr_le(A, V).
assr_lat(A, X) <= assr_lat(A, Y) :- Y < X.
